 270+ 6125 3D               DEC A
 271+ 6126 CA 7E 62         JP Z, .tgPhArmOut
 272+ 6129 3D               DEC A
 273+ 612A CA A3 62         JP Z, .tgPhPlayerTurn
 274+ 612D 3D               DEC A                               ; phase 10 (PLAYER_HIDE) deprecated
 275+ 612E 3D               DEC A                               ; phase 11 (PLAYER_FRAMED) deprecated
 276+ 612F 3D               DEC A
 277+ 6130 CA D8 62         JP Z, .tgPhPlayerExit
