 640+ 638B              ; TownGateErasePlayer - XOR-erase del sprite del player en (OLDX, OLDY)
 641+ 638B              ; ==============================================================================
 642+ 638B              TownGateErasePlayer:
 643+ 638B DD 21 4B 81      LD IX, EntityTable
 644+ 638F DD E5            PUSH IX
