 824+ 6472 CD E2 63         CALL TownGatePlayerXOR_BiClip
 825+ 6475 3A E7 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 826+ 6478 E6 F8            AND $F8
 827+ 647A 32 E7 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 828+ 647D 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 829+ 6480 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 830+ 6482                  ; Update OLD = current
