 304+ 6CA0                  ; --- Comparar room ---
 305+ 6CA0 3A AD 82         LD A, (CurrentScreenX)
 306+ 6CA3 BA               CP D
 307+ 6CA4 20 11            JR NZ, .rtfrSkip
 308+ 6CA6 3A AE 82         LD A, (CurrentScreenY)
 309+ 6CA9 BB               CP E
 310+ 6CAA 20 0B            JR NZ, .rtfrSkip
 311+ 6CAC
 312+ 6CAC 3A C0 6C         LD A, (.rtfrPosX)
 313+ 6CAF 47               LD B, A
 314+ 6CB0 3A C1 6C         LD A, (.rtfrPosY)
 315+ 6CB3 4F               LD C, A
 316+ 6CB4 CD 12 6C         CALL WriteTombAttrsCyan                 ; reset ATTR_BASE + CleanAttrMap
 317+ 6CB7
 318+ 6CB7              .rtfrSkip:
