  78+ 7176
  79+ 7176 2B               DEC HL
  80+ 7177 22 BF 5F         LD (MagicCompassTimer), HL
  81+ 717A
  82+ 717A                  ; Timer just expired? (HL=0 ahora) → silencio + reset path dir
  83+ 717A 7C               LD A, H
  84+ 717B B5               OR L
  85+ 717C 20 06            JR NZ, .umcStillActive
  86+ 717E 3E FF            LD A, $FF
  87+ 7180 32 C1 5F         LD (MagicCompassPathDir), A
  88+ 7183 C9               RET
  89+ 7184              .umcStillActive:
