  93+ 7187 34               INC (HL)
  94+ 7188
  95+ 7188                  ; --- Tick AY heartbeat ---
  96+ 7188 21 C4 5F         LD HL, MagicCompassTickCounter
  97+ 718B 7E               LD A, (HL)
  98+ 718C B7               OR A
  99+ 718D 28 05            JR Z, .umcTickFire                   ; counter=0 → dispara YA
