 229+ 722B 04 01            DEFB 4, 1                            ; nota 2: ~684 Hz
 230+ 722D 70 00            DEFW $0070
 231+ 722F 06 00            DEFB 6, 0                            ; nota 3: ~970 Hz, 240 ms (mas larga, last)
