 334+ 72AD                  ; --- Try each side ---
 335+ 72AD                  ; bit 0=N, bit 1=S, bit 2=W, bit 3=E
 336+ 72AD                  ; Probamos N: si bit 0 set, V = R - 16. Pero solo si R >= 16 (no wrap arriba).
 337+ 72AD 3A E6 73         LD A, (.cmcpExits)
