1317+ 975A              ; CheckPlayerZoneAtChar - test si la celda (D=cy, E=cx) es alcanzable
1318+ 975A              ; ==============================================================================
1319+ 975A              ; Lee FlowField (bank 6) en offset cy*32+cx. FlowField se actualiza al cambiar
1320+ 975A              ; de sala via MaiComputeFlowField llamado desde DrawScreen.
1321+ 975A              ; OUT: Z si NO alcanzable (FlowField == $FF), NZ si alcanzable.
1322+ 975A              ; Destruye: AF, BC, HL.
