1352+ 9780 3A E7 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
1353+ 9783 E6 F8            AND $F8
1354+ 9785 32 E7 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
1355+ 9788 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
1356+ 978B ED 79            OUT (C), A
