  58+ 9BEC 32 E7 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  59+ 9BEF 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  60+ 9BF2 ED 79            OUT (C), A
  61+ 9BF4 CD 4A E5         CALL AY_UpdateBellImpl
  62+ 9BF7 3A E7 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
  63+ 9BFA E6 F8            AND $F8
  64+ 9BFC 32 E7 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  65+ 9BFF 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  66+ 9C02 ED 79            OUT (C), A
  67+ 9C04 FB               EI
  68+ 9C05 C9               RET
