  88+ 9C28              ; --- AY_PlayBellChime: medianoche/iglesia, cold ---
  89+ 9C28              ; D = pan (-1=izq, 0=centro, +1=der). Preservar D atraviesa el thunk porque
  90+ 9C28              ; el patron page-switch no toca DE.
  91+ 9C28              AY_PlayBellChime:
