 513+ A403                  ; === STATE_RUNNING ===
 514+ A403                  ; Auto-transicion: nasty/monster + ScareTimer activo → STATE_SCARED
 515+ A403 3A 07 B9         LD A, (ScareTimer)
 516+ A406 B7               OR A
 517+ A407 28 1E            JR Z, .peRunning
 518+ A409 DD 7E 01         LD A, (IX+ENT_TYPE)
 519+ A40C FE 03            CP TYPE_NASTY
 520+ A40E 28 08            JR Z, .peDoScare
 521+ A410 FE 02            CP TYPE_MONSTER
 522+ A412 20 13            JR NZ, .peRunning
