1249+ A901
1250+ A901                  ; --- Consumir/regenerar stamina ---
1251+ A901 CD 83 AD         CALL UpdateStamina
1252+ A904                  ; --- Auto-select sword mode segun stamina ---
1253+ A904 CD D9 AD         CALL SelectSwordMode
