1260+ A911 FE 02            CP 2
1261+ A913 CA 79 A9         JP Z, .swordModeFree
1262+ A916
1263+ A916                  ; === MODO B: Cooldown fijo tras atacar ===
1264+ A916              .swordModeB:
1265+ A916 3A 67 B6         LD A, (AttackCooldown)
1266+ A919 B7               OR A
1267+ A91A 28 0D            JR Z, .bNoCooldown
1268+ A91C 3D               DEC A
1269+ A91D 32 67 B6         LD (AttackCooldown), A
