1271+ A923                  ; Cooldown terminado: restaurar color blanco
1272+ A923 CD A0 A9         CALL .setPlayerWhite
1273+ A926 C3 C7 A9         JP .running
1274+ A929              .bNoCooldown:
1275+ A929 3A 66 B6         LD A, (AttackTimer)
