1850+ AC81                  ; Prioridad: E/W sobre N/S
1851+ AC81 CB 57            BIT 2, A
1852+ AC83 20 0C            JR NZ, .runE
1853+ AC85 CB 5F            BIT 3, A
1854+ AC87 20 10            JR NZ, .runW
1855+ AC89 CB 47            BIT 0, A
1856+ AC8B 20 14            JR NZ, .runN
