1884+ ACAE 7A               LD A, D
1885+ ACAF FE 16            CP SPRID_ATTACK_EAST
1886+ ACB1 28 30            JR Z, .pushBackEast
1887+ ACB3 FE 1B            CP SPRID_ATTACK_WEST
1888+ ACB5 20 58            JR NZ, .noPushBack
1889+ ACB7
1890+ ACB7                  ; Attack west: comprobar X-8 en fila superior e inferior → mover +8
1891+ ACB7 D5               PUSH DE
1892+ ACB8 C5               PUSH BC
1893+ ACB9 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
1894+ ACBC D6 08            SUB 8
1895+ ACBE 47               LD B, A
1896+ ACBF DD 7E 04         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSY)
1897+ ACC2 4F               LD C, A
