1904+ ACD1 C6 14            ADD A, 20
1905+ ACD3 4F               LD C, A
1906+ ACD4 CD 0C D8         CALL IsPointBlocked
1907+ ACD7 28 34            JR Z, .noPushBackPop
1908+ ACD9              .doPushBackWest:
1909+ ACD9 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
