1911+ ACDE DD 77 03         LD (IX+ENT_POSX), A
1912+ ACE1 18 2A            JR .noPushBackPop
1913+ ACE3
1914+ ACE3                  ; Attack east: comprobar X+23 en fila superior E inferior → mover -8
1915+ ACE3              .pushBackEast:
1916+ ACE3 D5               PUSH DE
1917+ ACE4 C5               PUSH BC
1918+ ACE5 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
1919+ ACE8 C6 17            ADD A, 23
1920+ ACEA 47               LD B, A
1921+ ACEB DD 7E 04         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSY)
1922+ ACEE 4F               LD C, A
1923+ ACEF CD 0C D8         CALL IsPointBlocked
1924+ ACF2 20 11            JR NZ, .doPushBackEast
1925+ ACF4 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
1926+ ACF7 C6 17            ADD A, 23
1927+ ACF9 47               LD B, A
1928+ ACFA DD 7E 04         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSY)
1929+ ACFD C6 14            ADD A, 20
1930+ ACFF 4F               LD C, A
1931+ AD00 CD 0C D8         CALL IsPointBlocked
1932+ AD03 28 08            JR Z, .noPushBackPop
1933+ AD05              .doPushBackEast:
1934+ AD05 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
1935+ AD08 D6 08            SUB 8
1936+ AD0A DD 77 03         LD (IX+ENT_POSX), A
1937+ AD0D              .noPushBackPop:
1938+ AD0D C1               POP BC
1939+ AD0E D1               POP DE
1940+ AD0F              .noPushBack:
1941+ AD0F                  ; Si es animacion de ataque → SFX al inicio del primer swing
1942+ AD0F 7A               LD A, D
1943+ AD10 FE 16            CP SPRID_ATTACK_EAST
1944+ AD12 28 04            JR Z, .newAnimAttackSfx
1945+ AD14 FE 1B            CP SPRID_ATTACK_WEST
1946+ AD16 20 0F            JR NZ, .newAnimNoSfx
1947+ AD18              .newAnimAttackSfx:
1948+ AD18 3E 01            LD A, 1
1949+ AD1A 32 69 B6         LD (AttackSfxPlayed), A         ; Marcar: ya sono este ciclo
1950+ AD1D C5               PUSH BC
1951+ AD1E D5               PUSH DE
1952+ AD1F 21 68 F9         LD HL, SFX_Attack
1953+ AD22 CD F2 F8         CALL PlaySFX
1954+ AD25 D1               POP DE
1955+ AD26 C1               POP BC
1956+ AD27              .newAnimNoSfx:
1957+ AD27 DD 72 08         LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), D
