1997+ AD60 7A               LD A, D
1998+ AD61 FE 16            CP SPRID_ATTACK_EAST
1999+ AD63 28 04            JR Z, .checkWrapSfx
2000+ AD65 FE 1B            CP SPRID_ATTACK_WEST
2001+ AD67 20 16            JR NZ, .frameOk
2002+ AD69              .checkWrapSfx:
