2006+ AD6F C5               PUSH BC
2007+ AD70 D5               PUSH DE
2008+ AD71 21 68 F9         LD HL, SFX_Attack
2009+ AD74 CD F2 F8         CALL PlaySFX
2010+ AD77 D1               POP DE
2011+ AD78 C1               POP BC
2012+ AD79 18 04            JR .frameOk
2013+ AD7B              .wrapSfxSkip:
2014+ AD7B AF               XOR A
