2250+ AE98 29               ADD HL, HL                          ; (pixel_y/8)*32
2251+ AE99 3A BD 90         LD A, (WellPosX)
2252+ AE9C 0F               RRCA
2253+ AE9D 0F               RRCA
2254+ AE9E 0F               RRCA
2255+ AE9F E6 1F            AND $1F
2256+ AEA1 85               ADD A, L
2257+ AEA2 6F               LD L, A
