2642+ B0CB CB 3F            SRL A                               ; Rata: mitad del delay
2643+ B0CD B7               OR A
2644+ B0CE 20 01            JR NZ, .eAnimDelaySet
2645+ B0D0 3C               INC A                               ; Minimo 1
2646+ B0D1              .eAnimDelaySet:
2647+ B0D1 DD 77 09         LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), A
