2760+ B16F 18 DF            JR .moKbPreBorderOk
2761+ B171              .moKbPreOffscreen:
2762+ B171                  ; Sale de pantalla: restaurar pos y saltar directo a offscreen handler
2763+ B171 3A 5A B6         LD A, (.moSvX)
2764+ B174 DD 77 03         LD (IX+ENT_POSX), A
2765+ B177 3A 5B B6         LD A, (.moSvY)
