5422+ C011 FE 06            CP 6
5423+ C013 28 05            JR Z, .diurnal              ; 6 (A2) → diurnos
5424+ C015 21 EF BF         LD HL, CrepuscularTypeTable ; 2,3,4,5 → crepusculares
5425+ C018 18 03            JR .setTable
5426+ C01A              .diurnal:
