5647+ C15C                  ENDIF
5648+ C15C 3A FE E4         LD A, (CurrentTimeOfDay)
5649+ C15F FE 03            CP 3
5650+ C161 28 05            JR Z, .rmNight
5651+ C163 FE 04            CP 4
5652+ C165 28 01            JR Z, .rmNight
5653+ C167 C9               RET
5654+ C168              .rmNight:
5655+ C168 3A 71 B6         LD A, (MonstersActive)
