5657+ C16C C8               RET Z
5658+ C16D CD 3D C2         CALL .rmUpdateReturnTimers
5659+ C170 3A 39 C2         LD A, (.rmTimer)
5660+ C173 B7               OR A
5661+ C174 28 05            JR Z, .rmCheckSlots
5662+ C176 3D               DEC A
5663+ C177 32 39 C2         LD (.rmTimer), A
5664+ C17A C9               RET
5665+ C17B              .rmCheckSlots:
