5681+ C191 79               LD A, C
5682+ C192 21 55 C1         LD HL, MonsterTypeTable
5683+ C195 5F               LD E, A
5684+ C196 16 00            LD D, 0
5685+ C198 19               ADD HL, DE
5686+ C199 7E               LD A, (HL)
5687+ C19A              .rmHasTypeForTrap:
