5689+ C19C CB 3F            SRL A
5690+ C19E CB 3F            SRL A
5691+ C1A0 CB 3F            SRL A                               ; A = type idx 0..2
5692+ C1A2 21 3A C2         LD HL, .rmTrapBits
5693+ C1A5 5F               LD E, A
5694+ C1A6 16 00            LD D, 0
5695+ C1A8 19               ADD HL, DE
5696+ C1A9 7E               LD A, (HL)
5697+ C1AA 21 6D 82         LD HL, MonsterTrappedFlags
5698+ C1AD A6               AND (HL)
5699+ C1AE C2 2D C2         JP NZ, .rmSkip
5700+ C1B1                  ; Memoria de ubicacion: solo activar si MonsterRoomId[slot] == current.
5701+ C1B1                  ; Monsters migrados a otros rooms (via knockback) quedan TYPE_NONE hasta
5702+ C1B1                  ; que el player visite su room.
