5810+ C265 C3 F4 C2         JP .rmRtFallback
5811+ C268              .rmRtSideN:
5812+ C268                  ; target coord = cx = POSX / 8
5813+ C268 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
