6800+ C852              .udPost:
6801+ C852                  ; Stuck check para BFS: comparar POS post-call vs pre-call
6802+ C852 3A A1 82         LD A, (DeathPrevX)
6803+ C855 DD BE 03         CP (IX+ENT_POSX)
