6963+ C939 DD 36 0E 64      LD (IX+ENT_OLDSPRID), SPRID_DEATH
6964+ C93D DD 36 08 64      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), SPRID_DEATH
6965+ C941 DD 36 09 04      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), ENEMY_ANIM_DELAY
6966+ C945 DD 36 06 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAX), 0
6967+ C949 DD 36 07 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAY), 0
