7046+ C9B7              ; --- CheckDeathTouchPlayer: AABB completo 24x24 vs player (no margen) ---
7047+ C9B7              ; Si overlap: PlayerHealth=0, erase sprite, despawn.
7048+ C9B7              CheckDeathTouchPlayer:
