7374+ CBA8 78               LD A, B
7375+ CBA9 77               LD (HL), A
7376+ CBAA 23               INC HL
7377+ CBAB 3A 77 5F         LD A, (DBfsCurDepth)
7378+ CBAE 3C               INC A
