7385+ CBB5 3A 78 5F         LD A, (DBfsTryCx)
7386+ CBB8 57               LD D, A
7387+ CBB9 3A 72 5F         LD A, (DBfsPlayerCx)
7388+ CBBC 92               SUB D
7389+ CBBD 30 02            JR NC, .nbrAbsX
7390+ CBBF ED 44            NEG
7391+ CBC1              .nbrAbsX:
