7486+ CC3A 20 0D            JR NZ, .cfBlocked
7487+ CC3C 23               INC HL
7488+ CC3D 10 F9            DJNZ .cfCol
7489+ CC3F E1               POP HL
7490+ CC40 11 20 00         LD DE, 32
7491+ CC43 19               ADD HL, DE
7492+ CC44 0D               DEC C
7493+ CC45 20 EE            JR NZ, .cfRow
7494+ CC47 AF               XOR A                               ; Z
7495+ CC48 C9               RET
7496+ CC49              .cfBlocked:
