1086+ D59E 0F               RRCA
1087+ D59F 0F               RRCA
1088+ D5A0 E6 1F            AND $1F
1089+ D5A2 32 39 D6         LD (.roaEraseY), A
1090+ D5A5 7B               LD A, E
1091+ D5A6 0F               RRCA
1092+ D5A7 0F               RRCA
1093+ D5A8 0F               RRCA
