2251+ DABD 3E 03            LD A, PICKUP_FLASH_PERIOD
2252+ DABF 32 78 82         LD (PickupFlashFrames), A
2253+ DAC2 3A 77 82         LD A, (PickupFlashToggles)
2254+ DAC5 3D               DEC A
2255+ DAC6 32 77 82         LD (PickupFlashToggles), A
