2301+ DB02 EB               EX DE, HL                       ; HL = sprite ptr
2302+ DB03 3E 03            LD A, 3                         ; PickupTable ptrs viven en bank 3
2303+ DB05 CD 7A 6A         CALL LoadBgSpriteToBuffer
