 637+ F363 3A AD 82         LD A, (CurrentScreenX)
 638+ F366 32 6A 82         LD (LastCompassScreenX), A
 639+ F369 3A AE 82         LD A, (CurrentScreenY)
 640+ F36C 32 6B 82         LD (LastCompassScreenY), A
 641+ F36F C9               RET
