1600+ F7C9              ; WobblePhaseTable - 9 fases del wobble (1 frame cada una, 9 frames total).
1601+ F7C9              ; Indexada por (counter-1) -> 0..8. Valor:
1602+ F7C9              ;   0 = prev2, 1 = prev, 2 = target, 3 = next, 4 = next2.
1603+ F7C9              ; Con counter inicial 9 y decremento por frame:
1604+ F7C9              ;   counter 9 -> phase 8 -> prev2  (primer estado al entrar a la sala)
1605+ F7C9              ;   counter 8 -> phase 7 -> prev
1606+ F7C9              ;   counter 7 -> phase 6 -> target
1607+ F7C9              ;   counter 6 -> phase 5 -> next
1608+ F7C9              ;   counter 5 -> phase 4 -> next2
1609+ F7C9              ;   counter 4 -> phase 3 -> prev
1610+ F7C9              ;   counter 3 -> phase 2 -> target
1611+ F7C9              ;   counter 2 -> phase 1 -> prev
1612+ F7C9              ;   counter 1 -> phase 0 -> target (estado final, settle)
1613+ F7C9              ; ==============================================================================
