 195+ F9CE              ; --- SFX_CountdownTick: bip ~700ms para "3" y "2" del countdown ---
 196+ F9CE              ; Pitch 102 = ~1047 Hz. Calibrado para octava precisa con pitch 50 (ratio 1.992).
 197+ F9CE              ; (PlaySFX tiene ~78T de overhead por ciclo ademas de 32*pitch -> ratio puro
 198+ F9CE              ; 100/50 quedaria desafinado ~30 cents. Compensado a 102 da ~7 cents.)
 199+ F9CE              SFX_CountdownTick:
 200+ F9CE FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~239ms
 201+ F9D2 FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~478ms
 202+ F9D6 E6 66 00 00      DEFB 230, 102, 0, 0         ; ~219ms (total ~718ms)
 203+ F9DA 00               DEFB 0
 204+ F9DB
 205+ F9DB              ; --- SFX_CountdownGo: octava arriba del Tick, ~1s ---
 206+ F9DB              ; Pitch 50 = ~2086 Hz. Ratio period(102)/period(50) = 3342/1678 = 1.992.
 207+ F9DB              SFX_CountdownGo:
 208+ F9DB FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0          ; ~120ms cada step
 209+ F9DF FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 210+ F9E3 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 211+ F9E7 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 212+ F9EB FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 213+ F9EF FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 214+ F9F3 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 215+ F9F7 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 216+ F9FB 5A 32 00 00      DEFB 90, 50, 0, 0           ; total ~1003ms
 217+ F9FF 00               DEFB 0
 218+ FA00
